[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8342.309, "timestamp": "02:19:02", "text": "正义或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8344.309, "timestamp": "02:19:04", "text": "其他什么，认为自己仍然是对的。 即使我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8348.15, "timestamp": "02:19:08", "text": "闹剧已经被彻底揭穿，一切都彻底结束了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8354.309, "timestamp": "02:19:14", "text": "所有事情都尘埃落定了，对吧？ 所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8358.79, "timestamp": "02:19:18", "text": "，嗯，如果你因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8366.23, "timestamp": "02:19:26", "text": "和我互动、支持我之类的原因而被列入黑名单或被踢出服务器，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8368.469, "timestamp": "02:19:28", "text": "就不知道了。 我对此不承担任何责任"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8372.549, "timestamp": "02:19:32", "text": "。 呃，如果你愿意来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8374.87, "timestamp": "02:19:34", "text": "支持我，或者做任何事，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8377.27, "timestamp": "02:19:37", "text": "你根本不在乎其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8380.87, "timestamp": "02:19:40", "text": "创作者在做什么，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8382.549, "timestamp": "02:19:42", "text": "屏蔽支持我的人之类的，那都是你的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8385.11, "timestamp": "02:19:45", "text": "。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8388.07, "timestamp": "02:19:48", "text": "你们可以随意，这取决于你们这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8390.87, "timestamp": "02:19:50", "text": "希望我支持我的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8393.349, "timestamp": "02:19:53", "text": "。 所以，这取决于你。 如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8395.11, "timestamp": "02:19:55", "text": "不喜欢看我的内容，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8396.95, "timestamp": "02:19:56", "text": "或者对我的内容有"}]